units lj
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
lattice fcc 0.84419425715480489
region box block 0 6 0 6 0 6
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 1.0
pair_style lj/smooth/linear 2.5
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5
velocity all create 1.0 87287 dist gaussian mom yes rot no
neighbor 0.3 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
fix 1 all nve
timestep 0.005
thermo 200
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press
thermo_modify norm no flush yes
run 200
